<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Champion said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Champion said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read raised its rating of Champion Enterprises Inc to a buy from outperform on Thursday, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Dillon raised 1996 earnings per share estimates to $1.42 from $1.27 and 1997 estimates $1.65 from $1.50, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Chapmion shares were flat at 19-7/8.</p>
</text>
